flagtensor (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build NVIDIA native libraries and Python bindings.
  * Link against the system libtriton-jit-nvidia package.
  * Keep the backend-neutral Python package as a separate binary package.
  * Preserve distro-generated ELF dependencies while filtering vendor libraries.
  * Ship backend YAML configuration and accept distro dependency versions.
  * Avoid Jammy's CPython 3.10 matplotlib stack in the Python 3.12 runtime.

